--  A call that its server defers, for the Replacement test (#879). It is
--  Replaceable_Test's own interface, not one of the system's, so that it
--  doesn't freeze with them (ADR 0031).
--
--  Wait is deferred until Answer is called, and then returns Answer's
--  Value. Its reply is words only, so that a new version can answer it
--  (#878). Wait_With is Wait with Text, which is sent in a buffer, so
--  that its server holds the caller's buffer while it defers the call.
--  Waiting is the number of calls of either that are deferred, and
--  Answer answers both.

interface Held_Call is

   function Wait return Natural;

   function Wait_With (Text : String) return Natural;

   function Waiting return Natural;

   procedure Answer (Value : Natural);

end Held_Call;
